  "description": "Trapped in a hopeless burnout, painter Yu Yeong thought he would never create again, until Ha Jae-Hyeon moves into the home right across the street. Fascinated by his handsome new neighbor, Yeong begins observing him from afar, channeling his growing desire into secret nude paintings. What begins as a quiet, distant gaze soon ignites a burning temptation, drawing two lonely souls across the street and into an intense, passionate connection.\n\n(Source: Lezhin US)",
